    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ERW413 · Assessment 4/5</span>\n<h2>Assignment 4</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13894 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ERW413 · Đầu điểm 4/5</span>\n<h2>Assignment 4</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13894 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO7, LO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: *Answer ONE question in the &quot;Additional Assignments&quot; part at the end of chapter 7-8 or similar questions assigned by teacher // OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1 or 2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">lessons in learned chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">*homework; individual work</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 11 — Chapter 2: Annotating Texts and Developing Vocabulary (cont) + Assignment 1</li><li>Session 12 — Chapter 2: Annotating Texts and Developing Vocabulary (cont) + Assignment 1</li><li>Session 23 — Chapter 4: Main Ideas (cont) + Assignment 2</li><li>Session 24 — Chapter 4: Main Ideas (cont) + Assignment 2</li><li>Session 37 — Chapter 6: Text Purposes and Text Patterns (cont) + Assignment 3</li><li>Session 38 — Chapter 6: Text Purposes and Text Patterns (cont) + Assignment 3</li><li>Session 49 — Chapter 8: Titles, Introductions and Conclusions (cont) + Assignment 4</li><li>Session 50 — Chapter 8: Titles, Introductions and Conclusions (cont) + Assignment 4</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 11 — Chapter 2: Annotating Texts and Developing Vocabulary (cont) + Assignment 1</li><li>Buổi 12 — Chapter 2: Annotating Texts and Developing Vocabulary (cont) + Assignment 1</li><li>Buổi 23 — Chapter 4: Main Ideas (cont) + Assignment 2</li><li>Buổi 24 — Chapter 4: Main Ideas (cont) + Assignment 2</li><li>Buổi 37 — Chapter 6: Text Purposes and Text Patterns (cont) + Assignment 3</li><li>Buổi 38 — Chapter 6: Text Purposes and Text Patterns (cont) + Assignment 3</li><li>Buổi 49 — Chapter 8: Titles, Introductions and Conclusions (cont) + Assignment 4</li><li>Buổi 50 — Chapter 8: Titles, Introductions and Conclusions (cont) + Assignment 4</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
